Life-cycle assessment, detailed guidance — ILCD Handbook (@mat-ilcd: 0, is #reference, #part-of @mat-sources) { r_6YXH2DKX7XZRCE6XSCJ2QGJ3YX
European Commission, Joint Research Centre. *International Reference Life Cycle Data System Handbook: General Guide for Life Cycle Assessment—Detailed Guidance*. First edition, March 2010. JRC 48157, EUR 24708 EN, DOI 10.2788/38479. [Complete 417-page PDF](https://eplca.jrc.ec.europa.eu/uploads/ILCD-Handbook-General-guide-for-LCA-DETAILED-GUIDANCE-12March2010-ISBN-fin-v1.0-EN.pdf).

Read chapters 5–10 through a complete study, then the relevant annexes. Use the goal/scope chapters before collecting data, section 7.9 for multifunctionality, annex 14 for recycling and annex 16 for uncertainty. Read the full guide during the advanced life-cycle investigation.

Contents and selected data-representativeness, allocation, interpretation and uncertainty passages were inspected on 30 October 2026. The guide separates numerical uncertainty from methodological choices and scenarios. Its detailed recommendations belong to this edition and do not establish current legal or standards compliance.

Copyright European Union 2010; attributed reproduction is authorized in the publication. Preserve component credits. Refer to the external book; no inventory database, impact-factor dataset or commercial LCA software is bundled.

